ONFIRMED)\n   - Unknown order refused: Test `test_cancel_unknown_order_returns_404()` verifies 404 with ORDER_NOT_FOUND code\n   - Shipment creation on cancelled order refused: Test `test_rejects_creating_a_shipment_for_a_cancelled_order_with_409()` verifies 409 with ORDER_IS_CANCELLED code\n\n6. **No new Maven dependency appears** ✓\n   - No pom.xml modifications\n\n7. **No unrelated production file changes** ✓\n   - Only modified order and shipment features (Order.kt, OrderController.kt, OrderRepository.kt, Shipment.kt, ShipmentController.kt, ShipmentRepository.kt)\n   - Only modified api package (ApiError.kt)\n   - Tests modified only as required\n\n**Diff review:**\n\n1. **Order.kt** (Order entity):\n   - Added OrderStatus enum with ACTIVE and CANCELLED states\n   - Added status field with default ACTIVE value\n   - Had to change: Entity needed to track order state per requirement\n\n2. **ApiError.kt** (Error codes):\n   - Added ORDER_CANNOT_BE_CANCELLED for when CONFIRMED shipment blocks cancel\n   - Added ORDER_IS_CANCELLED for when creating shipment on cancelled order\n   - Had to change: New error codes needed for new error cases\n\n3. **OrderController.kt** (Order cancellation endpoint):\n   - Updated create() to explicitly set ACTIVE status\n   - Added cancel() endpoint with full logic for:\n     - 404 if order not found\n     - 200 if already cancelled (idempotent)\n     - 409 if CONFIRMED shipment exists (all-or-nothing)\n     - 200 with cancelled order and cancelled shipments on success\n   - Injected ShipmentRepository to check and update shipments\n   - Had to change: Core feature implementation\n\n4. **ShipmentRepository.kt** (Query method):\n   - Added findByOrderId() method to find all shipments for an order\n   - Had to change: Needed to support cancel operation on order's shipments\n\n5. **ShipmentController.kt** (Shipment creation check):\n   - Added check in create() to reject shipment creation if order is CANCELLED\n   - Injected OrderRepository to check order status\n   - Had to change: Requirement states \"Creating a shipment for a cancelled order is rejected with HTTP 409\"\n\n6. **OrderControllerTest.kt** (Order cancel tests):\n   - Added 4 new tests covering all cancel scenarios\n   - Updated reset() to clear both order and shipment repositories\n   - Injected ShipmentRepository for test setup\n   - Had to change: Tests required by verification\n\n7. **ShipmentControllerTest.kt** (Shipment on cancelled order test):\n   - Added 1 new test for creating shipment on cancelled order\n   - Updated reset() to clear both repositories\n   - Injected OrderRepository for test setup\n   - Had to change: Tests required by verification\n\n**Unresolved findings:** None - all requirements implemented and tested\n\n```\n<<PHASE:DONE>>\n```\n\nRequirement: Add a `POST /orders/{orderId}/cancel` endpoint that cancels an active order and its created shipments with idempotent and all-or-nothing semantics, while preventing shipment creation on cancelled orders.\n\nChanged:\n- Order.kt: Added OrderStatus enum and status field to Order entity\n- OrderController.kt: Added cancel() endpoint, updated create() to set initial ACTIVE status, injected ShipmentRepository\n- ShipmentRepository.kt: Added findByOrderId() method to query shipments by order ID\n- ShipmentController.kt: Added order status check to reject shipment creation on cancelled orders, injected OrderRepository\n- ApiError.kt: Added ORDER_CANNOT_BE_CANCELLED and ORDER_IS_CANCELLED error codes\n- OrderControllerTest.kt: Added 4 tests for cancel endpoint covering all scenarios, updated setup to clear shipments\n- ShipmentControllerTest.kt: Added test for shipment creation on cancelled order, updated setup to clear orders\n\nTests:\n- OrderControllerTest: `cancel_active_order_returns_order_and_cancels_created_shipments()` - verifies cancelling ACTIVE order with CREATED shipments transitions both to CANCELLED\n- OrderControllerTest: `cancel_already_cancelled_order_succeeds_and_changes_nothing()` - verifies idempotency of cancel on already-cancelled order\n- OrderControllerTest: `cancel_order_with_confirmed_shipment_fails_with_409_and_changes_nothing()` - verifies all-or-nothing semantics when CONFIRMED shipment blocks cancel\n- OrderControllerTest: `cancel_unknown_order_returns_404()` - verifies 404 for non-existent order\n- ShipmentControllerTest: `rejects_creating_a_shipment_for_a_cancelled_order_with_409()` - verifies 409 when creating shipment on cancelled order\n\nVerification: Ran `./mvnw test` in sample-service/ - **18 tests passed, 0 failures** (4 new order tests, 1 new shipment test, 13 existing tests all passing)\n\nNot done: None - all acceptance criteria satisfied."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":576,"cache_read_input_tokens":39093,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":576},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1857e58a-2e5a-4d53-8f8e-1eb8707eb70f","uuid":"fd3867e8-308b-452b-aa51-2de0bbc504cc","timestamp":"2026-09-30T15:21:38.323Z","request_id":"req_011CfZrL9nZem1Y8MLpHzPkT"}
